kunsten_be_flanders_0c520b567ceb,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/call-for-2027-curatorial-research-fellowship/,https://rencontresarles.typeform.com/to/WnwfW8TP,Arles - Les Rencontres de la photographie,"The Rencontres d’Arles curatorial research grant, worth 20,000 euros, is open to all exhibition curators. The selected project will be carried out in two phases: → research phase focusing on an exhibition project. → project production – subject to approval.",image or photography,curatorial research grant,France,Arles,"The grant, worth a maximum of 20,000 euros, consists of: → an initial sum of 5,000 euros in royalties, payable to the winner. → a second sum of 15,000 euros, subject to validation, to produce the project.",,,en,Call for 2027 curatorial research fellowship,The Rencontres d’Arles curatorial research grant is aimed at exhibition curators wishing to carry out an original project relating to image or photography.,Call for 2027 curatorial research fellowship,The Rencontres d’Arles curatorial research grant is aimed at exhibition curators wishing to carry out an original project relating to image or photography.,30 Nov 2026,2026-11-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.024716+00:00
