kunsten_be_flanders_b75775a347f7,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-for-artists-art-educators/,https://reon-space.com/air,REON,"REON is excited to announce that it is now accepting applications from international art practitioners & educators, working across diverse approaches to clay & ceramics, for its upcoming residency in September-October 2026 in Corfu island. An independent small scale program, and taking place in the mountainous village of Porta on the island of Corfu, it offers an open-ended environment for work, research and play.",clay & ceramics,Residency,Corfu island,Porta,"Provided by REON: Accommodation, access to a fully equipped ceramics studio, basic materials, facilitation and collaborative support, transportation ** Covered by the artist Vehicle rental (essential), food & personal expenses, extended material costs (excluding materials used in community projects, a voluntary contribution for utility costs, transportation ** Transportation ** Transportation costs for the Artist Educator Residency or a Combined Residency are fully covered. For the Artist Residency, there is a possibility that transportation expenses may also be covered fully or partially, depending on the available budget and whether the proposed project includes elements of engagement with local children.",15 Euro (to be payed via bank transfer),"Recent graduates are welcome to apply, as well as individuals who have gotten through a gap in their career, without need for further justification.",en,Open call for artists & art educators,"REON is excited to announce that it is now accepting applications from international art practitioners & educators, working across diverse approaches to clay & ceramics, for its upcoming residency in September-October 2026 in Corfu island. REON is keen to welcome professionals such as artists, researchers, designers, architects and other practitioners working across diverse approaches to clay. Recent graduates are welcome to apply, as well as individuals who have gotten through a gap in their career, without need for further justification. While the program centers on clay, we also consider proposals that do not directly engage with the material, but respond thoughtfully to the islandic context.",Open call for artists & art educators,"REON is excited to announce that it is now accepting applications from international art practitioners & educators, working across diverse approaches to clay & ceramics, for its upcoming residency in September-October 2026 in Corfu island. REON is keen to welcome professionals such as artists, researchers, designers, architects and other practitioners working across diverse approaches to clay. Recent graduates are welcome to apply, as well as individuals who have gotten through a gap in their career, without need for further justification. While the program centers on clay, we also consider proposals that do not directly engage with the material, but respond thoughtfully to the islandic context.",05 Jul 2026,2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.121448+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_b9f09f8cf7be,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-architect-in-residence-galicia-spain/,https://ocastroartvillage.com/open-call-architect-residency-o-castro-art-village/,O Castro Art Village,"We are inviting one architect to spend 30 days here during October 2026; not to rebuild, but to look, to measure, and to develop a site-specific spatial intervention study rooted in this place: its vernacular stone construction, its forest, its particular relationship between what was built and what grows.",architecture,Residency,Spain,Galicia,"Travel allowance €400 (€800 over 5,000 km) Daily allowance €30/day Accommodation on site Mentorship",,,en,"Open Call: Architect in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,"Open Call: Architect in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,05 Jul 2026,2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.125128+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_a47b959955e3,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-sound-artist-in-residence-galicia-spain/,https://ocastroartvillage.com/open-call-sound-artist-residency-o-castro-art-village/,O Castro Art Village,"We are inviting one sound artista or musician to spend 30 days here during October 2026 to develop a permanent sound installation across the village, accessible through QR codes placed at specific points in the landscape. Not a guided tour: a second presence, a sonic layer that visitors find as they move through the site.",Sound art / musician,Residency,Spain,Galicia,"Travel allowance €400 (€800 over 5,000 km) Daily allowance €30/day Accommodation on site Mentorship",,,en,"Open Call: Sound Artist in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,"Open Call: Sound Artist in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,05 Jul 2026,2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.127887+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_9b98d1b06cf2,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-visual-mixed-media-artist-in-residence-galicia-spain/,https://ocastroartvillage.com/open-call-visual-artist-residency-o-castro-art-village/,O Castro Art Village,"We are inviting one visual or mixed-media artist, with a particular interest in video or expanded image practices to spend 30 days here during October 2026 and develop a permanent installation integrated into the ruins or the landscape.",Visual / Mixed-Media,Residency,Spain,Galicia,"Travel allowance €400 (€800 over 5,000 km) Daily allowance €30/day Accommodation on site Mentorship",,,en,"Open Call: Visual / Mixed-Media Artist in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,"Open Call: Visual / Mixed-Media Artist in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,05 Jul 2026,2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.131072+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_696dbc1b4c63,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-temporary-centre-for-shared-practice/,,Kunsthal Gent,"Are you a Ghent-based visu­al artist under 30 , loo­king for a tem­po­ra­ry workspa­ce, a pla­ce for try-outs, and a col­lec­ti­ve wor­king atmos­p­he­re? From Sep­tem­ber until the end of Decem­ber 2026 , Kunst­hal Gent will trans­form into a sha­red workspace. We invi­te young artists to research, expe­ri­ment, get to know one ano­ther, and col­la­bo­ra­te.",visual arts,open call,Belgium,Ghent,"We offer a sha­red struc­tu­re, time, com­pa­ny, and support.",,young artists,en,Temporary centre for shared practice,"You are 30 years old or youn­ger . You hold a degree in hig­her arts edu­ca­ti­on (visu­al arts) . Any­o­ne gra­du­a­ting by Sep­tem­ber 2026 is wel­come to apply. You have a con­nec­ti­on to Ghent : you live in Ghent, have a studio or a gal­le­rist here, or recent­ly gra­du­a­ted from a Ghent art academy. You recog­ni­ze the value of a sup­por­ti­ve art field and the power of collaboration.",Temporary centre for shared practice,"You are 30 years old or youn­ger . You hold a degree in hig­her arts edu­ca­ti­on (visu­al arts) . Any­o­ne gra­du­a­ting by Sep­tem­ber 2026 is wel­come to apply. You have a con­nec­ti­on to Ghent : you live in Ghent, have a studio or a gal­le­rist here, or recent­ly gra­du­a­ted from a Ghent art academy. You recog­ni­ze the value of a sup­por­ti­ve art field and the power of collaboration.","Sunday, July 5, 2026, 23:59",2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.135343+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_57552991f169,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/prima-la-musica-zoekt-jong-talent-vijfde-editie-jubileum-2/,https://www.primalamusica.be/young-talent,Prima La Musica,"Prima La Musica, the chamber orchestra led by composer/conductor Dirk Brossé, is once again offering young musicians who aspire a professional career, six months of intensive coaching. This career boosting opportunity (fifth edition!) will unfold in various phases: one-on-one workshops, covering different aspects of the profession; artistic coaching; and a closing concert at Muziekcentrum De Bijloke (Ghent) on December 9th, 2026.",musicians,Workshop,Belgium,Ghent,,,young musicians who aspire a professional career,en,Prima La Musica seeks young talent (fifth edition),young musicians who aspire a professional career,Prima La Musica seeks young talent (fifth edition),young musicians who aspire a professional career,01 Jul 2026,2026-07-01,2026-09-23 12:37:25.138707+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_15a23e278f66,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-full-spectrum-curatorship-programme-2026/,https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd9E3PEevHy8rzvKY0g84qYX2-YZcWXLar8lZwDW_7_WxIghg/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=108158982485858052890,IMPAKT [Centre for Media Culture],"IMPAKT [Centre for Media Culture] invites emerging and aspiring curators with an interest in media art, digital culture, and the intersection of technology and society to apply for the Full Spectrum Curatorship Programme.","media art, digital culture, and the intersection of technology and society",Training,Netherlands,Utrecht,"During the final phase of the programme, participants will receive an €800 stipend to support the preparation of their final project proposal.",The fee for participation is €400.,"Recent graduates, as well as aspiring and emerging curators",en,Open Call Full Spectrum Curatorship Programme 2026,"Recent graduates, as well as aspiring and emerging curators, are invited to apply. Participants are expected to attend all sessions, including those in which fellow participants present and discuss their projects. Alongside the collective sessions, participants will take part in mentor sessions, either individually or in duos. The programme requires a minimum commitment of 8 hours per week, including preparation, research, and independent work. Please note that all sessions will be held in English.",Open Call Full Spectrum Curatorship Programme 2026,"Recent graduates, as well as aspiring and emerging curators, are invited to apply. Participants are expected to attend all sessions, including those in which fellow participants present and discuss their projects. Alongside the collective sessions, participants will take part in mentor sessions, either individually or in duos. The programme requires a minimum commitment of 8 hours per week, including preparation, research, and independent work. Please note that all sessions will be held in English.","23:59 (CET), 1 July 2026",2026-09-23,2026-09-23 12:37:25.146446+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_f3813b0a41ba,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/prima-la-musica-zoekt-jong-talent-vijfde-editie-jubileum/,https://www.primalamusica.be/young-talent,Prima La Musica,"Prima La Musica, the chamber orchestra led by composer/conductor Dirk Brossé, is once again offering young musicians who aspire a professional career, six months of intensive coaching. This career boosting opportunity (fifth edition!) will unfold in various phases: one-on-one workshops, covering different aspects of the profession; artistic coaching; and a closing concert at Muziekcentrum De Bijloke (Ghent) on December 9th, 2026. At this closing concert, the selected soloist will perform a work of his or her choosing together with Prima La Musica and the selected conductor will conduct one of the works selected for the concert programme. A unique opportunity for ambitious young musicians.",young musicians,call,Belgium,Ghent,six months of intensive coaching,,young musicians,en,Prima La Musica seeks young talent (fifth edition),young musicians who aspire a professional career,Prima La Musica seeks young talent (fifth edition),young musicians who aspire a professional career,01 Jul 2026,2026-07-01,2026-09-23 12:37:25.149449+00:00
