Available during the creation and performance period
Willing to explore, create and contribute to the project **We are looking for a diverse group, a mix of different profiles (from amateur to professional, dancers with different physical abilities, young and old, M/F/X, diverse backgrounds, etc.)",Open call: Masterclass movement & performativity TOGETHERNESS,"TOGETHERNESS is looking for eight dancers/movement artists who are interested in exploring, creating and supporting the project.

