institut_francais_programs_0e6d2766c96e,institut_francais_programs,https://www.institutfrancais.com/en/program/project-support/connect-create-strengthen-cultural-ties-between-Africa-and-Europe,https://forms.gle/3y5nvCNvHm5MEvNZ6,Institut français,"Connect & Create is the Sub-Saharan Africa component of the Africa–Europe Partnerships for Culture program, funded by the European Union.",Performing arts / Music,Project support,,,The mentees’ organizations will receive a grant to support their development and capacity building.,,young communications professionals,en,Connect & Create – Strengthening Cultural Ties Between Africa and Europe,"Applicants must be over 18 years of age , be proficient in French or English, and reside in South Africa, Benin, Cameroon, Ghana, Guinea, Kenya, Mali, Mozambique, Uganda, the Republic of the Congo, Rwanda or Senegal. Particular attention will be paid to their experience, motivation, local roots and audience reach.",Connect & Create – Strengthening Cultural Ties Between Africa and Europe,"Applicants must be over 18 years of age , be proficient in French or English, and reside in South Africa, Benin, Cameroon, Ghana, Guinea, Kenya, Mali, Mozambique, Uganda, the Republic of the Congo, Rwanda or Senegal. Particular attention will be paid to their experience, motivation, local roots and audience reach.",13 October 2026,2026-10-13,2026-09-23 13:53:40.020899+00:00
